  "_comment": "Canonical 18Dragon company data master (majors + minors). Tool-agnostic source of truth, like privates.json / trains.json. Wiring into 18dragon.json (map home tokens, logos) is a later step. Majors: 2 per region, referred to by abbrev in play, 6 tokens (home+4+destination), fixed destination (Home->Destination doubles the destination's value). Minors: 30 (6/region), referred to by number, white tokens (no color), each carries its home-region permit; a couple have special powers (C04).",
